       The curve is derived from the constraint rather than guessed: the field
       loses a fixed ~136px to the index rail, gutters and the clear button, and
       the longest placeholder runs about 9x the font size, so the largest size
       that still fits is (100vw - 136px) / 9. The slope below is that, minus
       5% so it is not sitting exactly on the limit; the cap hands back to the
       shared scale once there is room again. */
    .projects-search-input {
      font-size: clamp(1.125rem, -0.898rem + 10.56vw, 2.75rem);
